  "source_conclusion": "Inherit the complete public-CDK standalone bidi change through the advertised current peer. All25 owned NgModule bindings import and export the stable public BidiModule without providing, wrapping or redeclaring Dir. Both exact minimum peers import/export standalone Dir with unchanged nearest Directionality provider, host attribute and input/output contract. The documentation, test-host and API-guard hunks are individually accounted for; they do not authorize a CDK fork or new legacy facade API. The earlier mixed harness could receive Dir from unrelated imports, so it was insufficient by itself. The current isolated standalone component imports only legacy form-field/input modules and must execute seven direction stages and real teardown through actual legacy nodes. Require its equal rich raw/selected observation, preserved mixed predicate and complete same-run full106 packed evidence at the current clean source and exact artifact. Existing whole-public-module diagnostics are historical source/DI evidence, not a packed/native/floor pass. Product HTML/CSS/SCSS and conservative historical APIs remain unchanged; general Directionality callers, auto-locale behavior, all runtime floors and global G11 remain separate.",
  "decision": "Inherit the complete public-CDK standalone bidi change through the advertised current peer. All25 owned NgModule bindings import and export the stable public BidiModule without providing, wrapping or redeclaring Dir. Both exact minimum peers import/export standalone Dir with unchanged nearest Directionality provider, host attribute and input/output contract. The documentation, test-host and API-guard hunks are individually accounted for; they do not authorize a CDK fork or new legacy facade API. The earlier mixed harness could receive Dir from unrelated imports, so it was insufficient by itself. The current isolated standalone component imports only legacy form-field/input modules and must execute seven direction stages and real teardown through actual legacy nodes. Require its equal rich raw/selected observation, preserved mixed predicate and complete same-run full106 packed evidence at the current clean source and exact artifact. Existing whole-public-module diagnostics are historical source/DI evidence, not a packed/native/floor pass. Product HTML/CSS/SCSS and conservative historical APIs remain unchanged; general Directionality callers, auto-locale behavior, all runtime floors and global G11 remain separate.",
